---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Birmingham Jump Start"
  description="Disclaimer for the Birmingham Jump Start website: service information, advice and limitations."
  path="disclaimer/"
>
  <section class="hero hero-slim" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow rv"><span class="dot"></span>Legal</span>
      <h1 class="rv rv-d1">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="sub rv rv-d2">Last updated: 15 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="legal rv">
        <h2>Website information</h2>
        <p>The information on this website is provided for general guidance about our roadside services. While we work hard to keep it accurate, service details, response times and prices can change, and the quote we give you on the phone is always the final word.</p>
        <h2>Response times</h2>
        <p>We aim to reach customers within 30 to 40 minutes of their call in Birmingham. Actual arrival times depend on traffic, weather, your exact location and how busy we are. The arrival time we give you on the phone is our honest estimate at that moment.</p>
        <h2>Vehicle work</h2>
        <p>Our technicians take care with every vehicle, but older cars or cars with existing faults can behave unpredictably. If a jump start reveals a deeper problem, we will tell you honestly and discuss the options before doing more work.</p>
        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>This website may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or their privacy practices.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
